.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-ZIM 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-zim
.Nd inspect and select offline Wikipedia and ZIM content
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad zim
.Op Cm list | wikipedia | remote
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad zim
reports on the ZIM content known to the admin service.
ZIM files are the offline archives Kiwix serves, including Wikipedia,
Wiktionary, and other reference collections.
.Pp
With no subcommand,
.Cm list
runs and prints the installed-ZIM catalog as seen by the admin service.
The
.Cm wikipedia
subcommand reports the current Wikipedia download state and can request a
specific Wikipedia variant.
The
.Cm remote
subcommand lists ZIMs available to download from the remote catalog.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm list
Print the admin service's catalog of installed ZIMs.
This is the default when no subcommand is given.
.It Cm wikipedia Op Cm state | select Ar VARIANT
With
.Cm state
(the default), print the current Wikipedia download state.
With
.Cm select Ar VARIANT ,
request that variant for download, where
.Ar VARIANT
is one of
.Cm top-mini ,
.Cm top-nopic ,
.Cm all-mini ,
.Cm all-nopic ,
or
.Cm all-maxi .
.It Cm remote
List the ZIMs available in the remote catalog.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad zim list
Show the ZIMs currently installed.
.It Ic nomad zim wikipedia
Show the current Wikipedia download state.
.It Ic nomad zim wikipedia select all-nopic
Request the no-picture full Wikipedia variant.
.It Ic nomad zim remote
List ZIMs available to download.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-downloads 1 ,
.Xr nomad-fix-kiwix 1
